1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,510
In tissue culture, the ratio of the two hormones decides what a lump of callus becomes.

2
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:09,492
More auxin than cytokinin: roots.

3
00:00:09,492 --> 00:00:12,747
About equal: the callus just keeps growing.

4
00:00:12,747 --> 00:00:15,950
More cytokinin than auxin: shoots.

5
00:00:15,950 --> 00:00:23,424
This is Skoog and Miller's result from nineteen fifty-seven, and it is the most commonly reversed fact in this chapter.

